<title>USA: NEC unveils low-cost inkjet color printer.</title>
<headline>NEC unveils low-cost inkjet color printer.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEC Technologies Inc on Monday unveiled an entry-level color inkjet printer, the SuperScript 100C, at an estimated street price of $129.00, including a $40 rebate.</p>
<p>&quot;The SuperScript 100C was developed in response to specific customer demands for an entry-level color ink jet printer from NEC,&quot; said Tom Pavela, marketing director of NEC's printer division.</p>
<p>The SuperScript 100C will be available beginning in September.</p>
</text>
